0.00\",\"category_id\":\"7\",\"product_type_id\":\"2\",\"brand_id\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<div>Dan-K Soap has an elegant antifungal &amp; antibacterial property. Its contents like Ketoconazole &amp; Zinc Pyrithione is an antibacterial and anti fungal agent. It is effective in reducing and controlling bacterial contamination. Ketoconazole is an anti fungal drug used to prevent and treat skin and fungal infections. Zinc Pyrithione is best known for its use in treating dandruff and seborrhoiec dermatitis. It also has antibacterial properties and is effective against many pathogens. Aloevera helps treat inflammation, wounds and burns. The anti-allergic property of Aloe Vera is useful in the treatment of various skin diseases like eczema, psoriasis, itchy skin and so on. Glycerin is a wonderful skin moisturizer which helps retain skin water making it soft.<\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"4\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"0231611472387.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":null,\"exp\":null,\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-07-04T00:11:37.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-08-14T18:17:42.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"5244\",\"product_id\":\"31\",\"price\":\"180\",\"qty\":\"240\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"458\",\"sales_at\":\"2025-05-06 13:06:58\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-06T07:06:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-05-06T07:06:58.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"75 gm\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":87,\"product_name\":\"Dan K Shampoo\",\"image\":\"product.jpg\",\"price\":\"160.00\",\"discount_price\":\"0.00\",\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"180.00\",\"category_id\":\"1\",\"product_type_id\":\"1\",\"brand_id\":\"1\",\"description\":null,\"size_id\":\"1\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":null,\"in_stock\":\"0\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":null,\"exp\":null,\"is