ver, it may cause dryness, peeling, redness, and burning sensation at the application site. These side effects are usually mild and self-limiting. Most of these side effects can be prevented by using a skin moisturizer and drinking plenty of water. Serious side effects are rare. You must consult the doctor if you experience any allergic reaction (rashes, itching, swelling, shortness of breath, etc.).<br><br>Before using this medicine, it is important to tell your doctor if you are taking or have recently taken any other medicines for the same disease or other diseases. Pregnant and breastfeeding women should use this medicine with proper consultation and caution. If you are a known allergic to the medicine, you must refrain from using this medicine and consult your doctor. During the course of the treatment, do not touch, prick or scratch the infected skin areas as this may worsen or spread the acne. Avoid unnecessary sun exposure and use a sunscreen before stepping out in the sun. It is also advised, not to receive any cosmetic procedures without asking your doctor.<\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"9\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"gallery_image\":null,\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":null,\"exp\":null,\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-07-04T00:16:41.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-05-29T13:25:03.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6218\",\"product_id\":\"43\",\"price\":\"220\",\"qty\":\"40\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"464\",\"sales_at\":\"2025-11-27 19:45:32\",\"created_at\":\"2025-11-27T13:45:32.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-27T13:45:32.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"30 gm\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-06-26T22:42:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-06-26T22:42:58.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":32,\"product_name\":\"Permiscab Soap\",\"image\":\"permiscab-soap-2021-01-19.jpg\",\"price\":\"400.00\",\"discount_price\":\"0.00\",\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"130.00\",\"category_id\":\"7\",\"product_type_id\":\"2\",\"brand_id\":\"3\",\"description\":\"<div>Permiscab Anti Lice &amp; Anti Scabies Soap<br>Permiscab soap has an elegant anti-Lice &amp; anti-scabies property. Its contents like Permethrin is an anti-lice and anti scabies agent used to eradicate parasities such as head lice and mites responsible for scabiesm Aloe Vera extracts has antibacterial and antifungal property,which may help in the treatment of wound and burn healing,minor skin infections. It is a natural skin moisturizer &amp; conditioner which revitalizes the skin.<br>Direction for use: Apply Permiscab Soap to the affected part of the skin &amp; rub gently to develop the rich later. Protect from heat &amp; Light.<br>Avoid Contact with Eyes If Contact Occurs. Flush With Water Immediately.<br><br>Composition:&nbsp;<br>Permethrin 1.0% v\\/w<br>Aloe Vera 4.0% v\\/w<br>Glycerin Ip 3.5% v\\/w<br>Soap Noodles o.s<br>Excipients o.s<br>Perfume and Colour:<br>Titanium Dioxide<br>Net Wt. :75 gm.(When Packed)<br><br>Mfgr.&amp;Exporter:<br>Elegant International<br>Plot No.33,G.I.D.C.,Kuvadava-360 023.<br>Country of Origin India<br><br><\\/div><div><br><br><\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"4\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"08271611022785.jpeg\\\",\\\"18911611022785.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2019-09-30T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2022-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-07-04T00:12:11.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-08-14T06:08:21.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6218\",\"product_id\":\"32\",\"price\":\"170\",\"qty\":\"60\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"464\",\"sales_at\":\"2025-11-27 19:45:32\",\"created_at\":\"2025-11-27T13:45:32.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-27T13:45:32.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"75 gm\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\"}}],