":\"<div>Glessom Clintouch Face Wash contains Aloevera Extract which reduces acne and helps lighten blemishes. Vitamins B3, and E which provide moisturizing effect necessary for your skin. The antibacterial properties in Calendula Extract help in clearing the bacteria in the skin pores which may lead to acne outbreak. Rosemary Extract has powerful disinfectant and antiseptic properties. These help in treating acne and oily skin conditions.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Ingredients: <br><\\/strong>Salicylic Acid, Aloevera Extract, Vitamin-E, Calendula Extract, Rosemary Extract, Niacinamide, Carbopol, Dmdm Hydantoin, Sodium Lauryl Ethyl Sulphate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, EDTA, Propylene Glycol, Perfume, Triethanolamine, D-Panthenol, Butylated Hydroxytoluene &amp; Water.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Direction of use: <br><\\/strong>Apply Clintouch Face Wash mixed with water, work into foamy lather. Gently massage on your wet face and neck with a circular motion. Rinse off with clean water and pat your face dry. For best results use twice or thrice a day regularly.<\\/div><div><br><br><\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"17\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"06131611467540.jpeg\\\",\\\"11911611467541.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2020-09-30T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2023-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-10T16:11:30.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-05-29T13:20:20.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6249\",\"product_id\":\"88\",\"price\":\"350\",\"qty\":\"120\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"463\",\"sales_at\":\"2025-12-01 15:17:57\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-01T09:17:57.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-01T09:17:57.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"60 ml\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":35,\"product_name\":\"Ketocite CT Shampoo\",\"image\":\"ketocite-ct-shampoo-2020-10-23.jpg\",\"price\":\"650.00\",\"discount_price\":\"0.00\",\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"180.00\",\"category_id\":\"8\",\"product_type_id\":\"6\",\"brand_id\":\"3\",\"description\":\"<div>Ketocite-CT is a Keratoytic and Antifungal. It works by slowing bacterial growth and loosing and softening scales and crust.Ketoconazoleis antifungal agent which offers antifungal action while the Coal Tar relieving itching, scaling, dryness, and flaking of the skin due to dandruff, psoriasis and seborrhea.<\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"1\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":null,\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":null,\"exp\":null,\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-07-04T00:13:41.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-10-08T18:04:49.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6249\",\"product_id\":\"35\",\"price\":\"300\",\"qty\":\"100\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"463\",\"sales_at\":\"2025-12-01 15:17:57\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-01T09:17:57.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-01T09:17:57.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"100 ml\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-06-12T10:01:36.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-06-12T10:01:36.000000Z\"}}],\"user\":{\"id\":463,\"name\":\"Md Rana (Khulna)2025\",\"proprietor\":\"Md Rana\",\"email\":null,\"inventory_email\":null,\"phone\":\"01919020298\",\"custom_email\":null,\"address\":\"Khulna\",\"company\":null,\"division_id\":\"3\",\"email_verified_at\":null,\"user_type\":\"pos\",\"image\":\"user.jpg\",\"status\":\"0\",\"pricedata\":null,\"section_id\":\"1\",\"provider\":null,\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-01-16T12:40:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-01-16T12:40:00.000000Z\"}},\"customerName\":\"Md Rana (Khulna)2025\",\"oldProductText\":\"<li>Clintouch Acne Care Facewash = 120 x 350  = 42000<\\/li><li>Ketocite CT Shampoo = 100 x 300  = 30000<\\/li>\",\"newProductText\":\"<li>Ketocite CT Shampoo = 100 x 300  = 30000<\\/li>\",\"c