henol, Butylated Hydroxytoluene &amp; Water.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Direction of use: <br><\\/strong>Apply Clintouch Face Wash mixed with water, work into foamy lather. Gently massage on your wet face and neck with a circular motion. Rinse off with clean water and pat your face dry. For best results use twice or thrice a day regularly.<\\/div><div><br><br><\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"17\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"06131611467540.jpeg\\\",\\\"11911611467541.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2020-09-30T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2023-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-10T16:11:30.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-05-29T13:20:20.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6334\",\"product_id\":\"88\",\"price\":\"350\",\"qty\":\"25\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"480\",\"sales_at\":\"2025-12-20 12:35:44\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-20T06:35:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-20T06:35:44.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"60 ml\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\"}}],\"user\":{\"id\":480,\"name\":\"Md Harun (2025)\",\"proprietor\":\"Md Harun\",\"email\":null,\"inventory_email\":null,\"phone\":\"01915138972\",\"custom_email\":null,\"address\":\"Panthapath\",\"company\":null,\"division_id\":\"6\",\"email_verified_at\":null,\"user_type\":\"pos\",\"image\":\"user.jpg\",\"status\":\"0\",\"pricedata\":null,\"section_id\":\"1\",\"provider\":null,\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-02-06T10:37:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-02-09T06:19:48.000000Z\"}},\"customerName\":\"Md Harun (2025)\",\"oldProductText\":\"<li>Oxyflex = 50 x 400  = 20000<\\/li><li>Ketmir = 25 x 300  = 7500<\\/li><li>Clintouch Acne Care Facewash = 25 x 350  = 8750<\\/li>\",\"newProductText\":\"<li>Oxyflex = 1 x 400  = 400<\\/li><li>Ketmir = 25 x 300  = 7500<\\/li><li>Clintouch Acne C