ium Lauryl Ethyl Sulphate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, EDTA, Propylene Glycol, Perfume, Triethanolamine, D-Panthenol, Butylated Hydroxytoluene &amp; Water.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Direction of use: <br><\\/strong>Apply Clintouch Face Wash mixed with water, work into foamy lather. Gently massage on your wet face and neck with a circular motion. Rinse off with clean water and pat your face dry. For best results use twice or thrice a day regularly.<\\/div><div><br><br><\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"17\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"06131611467540.jpeg\\\",\\\"11911611467541.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2020-09-30T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2023-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-10T16:11:30.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-05-29T13:20:20.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6417\",\"product_id\":\"88\",\"price\":\"350\",\"qty\":\"600\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"438\",\"sales_at\":\"2026-01-07 11:59:52\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-07T05:59:52.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-07T05:59:52.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"60 ml\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":264,\"product_name\":\"Acnofa Soap\",\"image\":\"product.jpg\",\"price\":\"0.00\",\"discount_price\":null,\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"0.00\",\"category_id\":\"1\",\"product_type_id\":\"2\",\"brand_id\":\"11\",\"description\":null,\"size_id\":\"4\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":null,\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2021-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2024-02-28T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2022-04-04T09:18:46.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2022-04-04T09:18:46.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6417\",\"product_id\":\"264\",\"price\":\"180\",\"qty\":\"200\",\"free\":\"0\"