636  customer:   Wahidullah(2026) address:  pabna,  please approve the invoice again,Thanks\",\"salesDetails\":{\"id\":6636,\"user_id\":572,\"discount\":0,\"carrying_and_loading\":0,\"sales_at\":\"2026-02-23T04:21:12.000000Z\",\"amount\":54000,\"sales_status\":0,\"provided_by\":\"Nasifa Nawal Jui\",\"approved_by\":null,\"edited\":true,\"changes_text\":\"prev. date : 2026-02-22 current date 2026-02-23 \",\"delivery_status\":\"0\",\"delivery_marked_by\":null,\"deliveryinfo\":null,\"is_condition\":0,\"condition_amount\":0,\"delivered_at\":null,\"reference\":\"\",\"cust_sms\":\"0\",\"d_agent_sms\":\"1\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-02-22T09:57:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-23T04:21:12.000000Z\",\"product\":[{\"id\":88,\"product_name\":\"Clintouch Acne Care Facewash\",\"image\":\"cleantouch-acne-care-facewash-2021-01-24.jpg\",\"price\":\"450.00\",\"discount_price\":\"0.00\",\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"120.00\",\"category_id\":\"7\",\"product_type_id\":\"7\",\"brand_id\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<div>Glessom Clintouch Face Wash contains Aloevera Extract which reduces acne and helps lighten blemishes. Vitamins B3, and E which provide moisturizing effect necessary for your skin. The antibacterial properties in Calendula Extract help in clearing the bacteria in the skin pores which may lead to acne outbreak. Rosemary Extract has powerful disinfectant and antiseptic properties. These help in treating acne and oily skin conditions.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Ingredients: <br><\\/strong>Salicylic Acid, Aloevera Extract, Vitamin-E, Calendula Extract, Rosemary Extract, Niacinamide, Carbopol, Dmdm Hydantoin, Sodium Lauryl Ethyl Sulphate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, EDTA, Propylene Glycol, Perfume, Triethanolamine, D-Panthenol, Butylated Hydroxytoluene &amp; Water.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Direction of use: <br><\\/strong>Apply Clintouch Face Wash mixed with water, work into foamy lather. Gently massage on your wet face and neck with a circular motion. Rinse off with clean water and pat your face dry. For best results use twice or thrice a day regularly.<\\/div><div><br><br><\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"17\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"06131611467540.jpeg\\\",\\\"11911611467541.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2020-09-30T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2023-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-10T16:11:30.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-05-29T13:20:20.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6636\",\"product_id\":\"88\",\"price\":\"350\",\"qty\":\"100\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"572\",\"sales_at\":\"2026-02-22 15:57:58\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-22T09:57:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-22T09:57:58.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"60 ml\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":413,\"product_name\":\"Dermolu X Soap\",\"image\":\"product.jpg\",\"price\":\"0.00\",\"discount_price\":null,\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"0.00\",\"category_id\":\"1\",\"product_type_id\":\"2\",\"brand_id\":\"5\",\"description\":null,\"size_id\":\"4\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":null,\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":null,\"exp\":null,\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-07-07T05:22:11.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-07-07T05:22:11.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6636\",\"product_id\":\"413\",\"price\":\"200\",\"qty\":\"50\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"572\",\"sales_at\":\"2026-02-22 15:57:58\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-22T09:57:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-22T09:57:58.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"75 gm\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":32,\"product_name\":\"Permiscab Soap\",\"image\":\"permiscab-soap-2021-