  customer:   Wahidullah(2026) address:  pabna,  please approve the invoice again,Thanks\",\"salesDetails\":{\"id\":6636,\"user_id\":572,\"discount\":0,\"carrying_and_loading\":0,\"sales_at\":\"2026-02-26T03:50:35.000000Z\",\"amount\":54000,\"sales_status\":0,\"provided_by\":\"Nasifa Nawal Jui\",\"approved_by\":null,\"edited\":true,\"changes_text\":\"prev. date : 2026-02-25 current date 2026-02-26 \",\"delivery_status\":\"0\",\"delivery_marked_by\":null,\"deliveryinfo\":null,\"is_condition\":0,\"condition_amount\":0,\"delivered_at\":null,\"reference\":\"\",\"cust_sms\":\"0\",\"d_agent_sms\":\"1\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-02-22T09:57:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-26T03:50:35.000000Z\",\"product\":[{\"id\":88,\"product_name\":\"Clintouch Acne Care Facewash\",\"image\":\"cleantouch-acne-care-facewash-2021-01-24.jpg\",\"price\":\"450.00\",\"discount_price\":\"0.00\",\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"120.00\",\"category_id\":\"7\",\"product_type_id\":\"7\",\"brand_id\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<div>Glessom Clintouch Face Wash contains Aloevera Extract which reduces acne and helps lighten blemishes. Vitamins B3, and E which provide moisturizing effect necessary for your skin. The antibacterial properties in Calendula Extract help in clearing the bacteria in the skin pores which may lead to acne outbreak. Rosemary Extract has powerful disinfectant and antiseptic properties. These help in treating acne and oily skin conditions.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Ingredients: <br><\\/strong>Salicylic Acid, Aloevera Extract, Vitamin-E, Calendula Extract, Rosemary Extract, Niacinamide, Carbopol, Dmdm Hydantoin, Sodium Lauryl Ethyl Sulphate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, EDTA, Propylene Glycol, Perfume, Triethanolamine, D-Panthenol, Butylated Hydroxytoluene &amp; Water.<\\/div><div><br><strong>Direction of use: <br><\\/strong>Apply Clintouch Face Wash mixed with water, work into foamy lather. Gently massage on your wet face and neck with a circular motion. Rinse off with clean water and pat your face dry. For best results use twice or thrice a day regularly.<\\/div><div><br><br><\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"17\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"06131611467540.jpeg\\\",\\\"11911611467541.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2020-09-30T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2023-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-10T16:11:30.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-05-29T13:20:20.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6636\",\"product_id\":\"88\",\"price\":\"350\",\"qty\":\"100\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"572\",\"sales_at\":\"2026-02-25 10:42:28\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-25T04:42:28.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-25T04:42:28.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"60 ml\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-08-17T11:03:58.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":413,\"product_name\":\"Dermolu X Soap\",\"image\":\"product.jpg\",\"price\":\"0.00\",\"discount_price\":null,\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"0.00\",\"category_id\":\"1\",\"product_type_id\":\"2\",\"brand_id\":\"5\",\"description\":null,\"size_id\":\"4\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":null,\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":null,\"exp\":null,\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2025-07-07T05:22:11.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-07-07T05:22:11.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6636\",\"product_id\":\"413\",\"price\":\"200\",\"qty\":\"50\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"572\",\"sales_at\":\"2026-02-25 10:42:28\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-25T04:42:28.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-25T04:42:28.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"75 gm\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-06-13T10:01:35.000000Z\"}},{\"id\":32,\"product_name\":\"Permiscab Soap\",\"image\":\"permiscab-soap-2021-01-19.jpg\",\"price\":\"400.00\",\"discount_price\":\"0.00\",\"current_price\":\"0.00\",\"tp\":\"130.00\",\"category_id\":\"7\",\"product_type_id\":\"2\",\"brand_id\":\"3\",\"description\":\"<div>Permiscab Anti Lice &amp; Anti Scabies Soap<br>Permiscab soap has an elegant anti-Lice &amp; anti-scabies property. Its contents like Permethrin is an anti-lice and anti scabies agent used to eradicate parasities such as head lice and mites responsible for scabiesm Aloe Vera extracts has antibacterial and antifungal property,which may help in the treatment of wound and burn healing,minor skin infections. It is a natural skin moisturizer &amp; conditioner which revitalizes the skin.<br>Direction for use: Apply Permiscab Soap to the affected part of the skin &amp; rub gently to develop the rich later. Protect from heat &amp; Light.<br>Avoid Contact with Eyes If Contact Occurs. Flush With Water Immediately.<br><br>Composition:&nbsp;<br>Permethrin 1.0% v\\/w<br>Aloe Vera 4.0% v\\/w<br>Glycerin Ip 3.5% v\\/w<br>Soap Noodles o.s<br>Excipients o.s<br>Perfume and Colour:<br>Titanium Dioxide<br>Net Wt. :75 gm.(When Packed)<br><br>Mfgr.&amp;Exporter:<br>Elegant International<br>Plot No.33,G.I.D.C.,Kuvadava-360 023.<br>Country of Origin India<br><br><\\/div><div><br><br><\\/div>\",\"size_id\":\"4\",\"type\":\"pos\",\"gallery_image\":\"[\\\"08271611022785.jpeg\\\",\\\"18911611022785.jpeg\\\"]\",\"in_stock\":\"1\",\"unit_id\":\"1\",\"mfg\":\"2019-09-30T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"exp\":\"2022-08-31T18:00:00.000000Z\",\"is_price_confidential\":\"0\",\"discontinued\":\"0\",\"deleted_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2020-07-04T00:12:11.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2021-08-14T06:08:21.000000Z\",\"pivot\":{\"sale_id\":\"6636\",\"product_id\":\"32\",\"price\":\"180\",\"qty\":\"50\",\"free\":\"0\",\"user_id\":\"572\",\"sales_at\":\"2026-02-25 10:42:28\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-25T04:42:28.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-25T04:42:28.000000Z\"},\"size\":{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"75 gm\",\"type\":\"ecom\",\"deleted