5:56:47','2020-10-24 05:56:47'),(23,'Medicine','medicine-2020-11-09.jpg',1,'2020-11-09 08:01:03','2020-11-09 08:01:03'),(24,'Dish Wash liquid','dish-wash-liquid-2020-11-27.jpg',1,'2020-11-26 12:03:01','2020-11-26 22:56:48'),(25,'house hold','house-hold-2020-11-27.jpg',1,'2020-11-26 12:05:09','2020-11-26 23:00:31'),(26,'Kids Clothings','kids-clothings-2020-11-29.jpg',1,'2020-11-28 19:50:19','2020-11-28 19:50:19'),(27,'Serum','serum-2020-12-21.jpg',1,'2020-12-21 04:55:35','2020-12-21 04:55:35'),(28,'Perfume','perfume-2020-12-31.jpeg',1,'2020-12-31 03:20:24','2020-12-31 03:37:28'),(29,'Lotion','lotion-2021-01-18.jpg',1,'2021-01-18 00:00:52','2021-01-18 00:00:52'),(30,'health supplement','health-supplement-2021-08-15.jpg',0,'2021-08-14 12:13:14','2021-08-14 12:13:14'),(35,'powder',NULL,0,'2021-10-12 00:42:40','2021-10-12 00:42:40'),(36,'Dusting powder',NULL,0,'2021-11-09 16:22:18','2021-11-09 16:22:18'),(37,'food supplement','food-supplement-2022-03-18.jpg',0,'2022-03-18 13:37:34','2022-03-18 13:37:34'),(38,'Box',NULL,0,'2022-08-01 16:48:29','2022-08-01 16:48:29'),(39,'Paper',NULL,0,'2022-09-13 17:18:16','2022-09-13 17:18:16'),(40,'Bottle',NULL,0,'2022-10-03 16:15:07','2022-10-03 16:15:07'),(41,'Tab.',NULL,0,'2024-03-27 11:25:16','2024-03-27 11:25:16'),(42,'Drop',NULL,0,'2024-03-27 11:26:37','2024-03-27 11:26:37'),(43,'Cleanser',NULL,0,'2025-04-23 16:48:45','2025-04-23 16:48:45'),(44,'Moisture',NULL,0,'2025-11-26 16:31:20','2025-11-26 16:31:20'),(45,'Moisturizer',NULL,0,'2025-11-26 16:32:18','2025-11-26 16:32:18');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `product_types` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS `products`;
/*!40101 SET @saved_cs_client     = @@character_set_client */;
/*!50503 SET character_set_client = utf8mb4 */;
CREATE TABLE `products` (
  `id` bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  `product_name` varchar(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `image` varchar(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL DEFAULT 'product.jpg',
  `price` double(14,2) NOT NULL,
  `discount_price` double(14,2) DEFAULT NULL,
  `current_price` double(14,2) DEFAULT NULL,
  `tp` double(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00',
  `category_id` bigint unsigned NOT NULL,
  `product_type_id` bigint unsigned NOT NULL,
  `brand_id` bigint unsigned NOT NULL,
  `description` text CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  `size_id` int NOT NULL,
  `type` varchar(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `gallery_image` varchar(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci DEFAULT NULL,
  `in_stock` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `unit_id` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '1',
  `mfg` date DEFAULT NULL,
  `exp` date DEFAULT NULL,
  `is_price_confidential` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `discontinued` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `deleted_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,
  `created_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,
  `updated_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),
  KEY `products_category_id_foreign` (`category_id`),
  KEY `products_subcategory_id_foreign` (`product_type_id`),
  KEY `products_brand_id_foreign` (`brand_id`),
  CONSTRAINT `products_brand_id_foreign` FOREIGN KEY (`brand_id`) REFERENCES `brands` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  CONSTRAINT `products_category_id_foreign` FOREIGN KEY (`category_id`) REFERENCES `categories` (`id`),
  CONSTRAINT `products_product_type_id_foreign` FOREIGN KEY (`product_type_id`) REFERENCES `product_types` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE
) ENGINE=InnoDB AUTO_INCREMENT=488 DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
/*!40101 SET character_set_client = @saved_cs_client */;

LOCK TABLES `products` WRITE;
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `products` DISABLE KEYS */;
INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (1,'Regency Neem Tulshi Honey Facewash','regency-neem-tulshi-honey-facewash-2020-07-15.jpg',250.00,0.00,0.00,120.00,1,7,1,'<div>Gentle For Every Skin Regency Neem Facewash Cleanses your skin &amp; glow you much</div>',1,'pos',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'2020-06-12 14:04:11','2021-10-12 19:33:34'),(2,'Regency Scalp Care Shampoo','regency-scalp-care-shampoo-2020-07-15.jpg',350.00,0.00,0.00,240.00,1,6,1,'<div>Wheat Germ Extract is a rich, unrefined oil with a thick texture. It contains a host of vitamins that benefits the hair and scalp including vitamin A, E and D as well as a number of B vitamins -B1, B2, B3 and B6. Rosemary Oil helps to stimulate hair follicles, making hair grow longer and stronger. It is also believed that Rosemary Oil slows down premature hair loss and graying of the hair. Tea Tree Oil effectively moisturizes hair so that your scalp remains free of dry and itchy scalp, the root cause of dandruff. It combats and prevents bacterial, viral or any other microbial infections so that your scalp remains healthy and in ideal condition to have hair growth. Zinc pyrithione, an effective antifungal and antibacterial agent, is an often-prescribed medication to treat dandruff and other symptoms related to scalp and hair.</div>',2,'pos',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'2020-06-12 14:15:01','2021-10-12 19:34:12'),(3,'Regency Melasma  Cream','regency-hm-mechta-cream-2020-07-15.jpg',400.00,0.00,0.00,220.00,7,3,1,'<div>Works For Mechta</div>',3,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2019-04-01','2022-03-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-06-13 13:48:12','2021-08-14 12:00:01'),(4,'Regency Sandal Soap','regency-sandal-soap-2020-07-15.jpg',100.00,0.00,0.00,50.00,7,2,1,'<div>Regency Sandal Turmeric Soap helps soften skin by increasing its ability to retain moisture. Its contents are powerful anti-aging agents.</div>',4,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'2020-06-13 14:01:19','2021-10-12 19:33:49'),(5,'Vico Hand Wash (Ocen Blue)','vico-hand-wash-2020-07-15.jpg',150.00,0.00,0.00,65.00,1,1,2,'<div>Only 10 seonds for work</div>',5,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-06-13 14:09:13','2021-05-30 15:26:11'),(6,'Elegant Baby Soap','elegant-baby-soap-2020-07-15.jpg',250.00,0.00,0.00,70.00,7,2,3,'<div>This soap contain Aloevera, Vitamin-E, Shea butter and Olive Oil. This soap is laboratory-tested by quality experts to ensure its quality. The given soaps are made accessible in numerous packaging options to suit various demand of our customers. Aloevera soothes &amp; moisturizes your baby\'s skin and gives it a healthy glow. Shea Butter nourishes and protects your baby\'s skin like nothing else available. Olive Oil is among the best natural remedies when it comes to dealing with diaper rashes and many other skin conditions. Vitamin E helps to keep your baby\'s skin smooth and avoids any dryness.</div>',4,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2019-11-01','2022-10-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-06-17 00:17:55','2021-08-14 12:00:56'),(7,'Aifujiapin Soap','aifujiapin-soap-2020-10-07.jpg',500.00,0.00,0.00,350.00,7,2,4,'<div>Detoxification Soap</div>',4,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2020-01-01','2023-01-31',0,0,NULL,'2020-06-17 00:22:13','2021-08-14 12:01:48'),(8,'Elegant Vitashine Max','elegant-vitashine-max-2020-07-15.jpg',350.00,0.00,0.00,225.00,7,3,3,'<div>Cream combines ingredients to tackle a dull, uneven complexion and clear dark spots, discolored and pigmented skin. It has a unique formulation which ensures easy application, faster absorption better nourishment to the skin. Formulated specially to give you a flawless complexion. Smoothing it onto cleansed skin every morning and evening will give you a skin that\'s fair and glowing from within. enhances the complexion, evens out skin tone, imparts a natural glow, lightens the skin, reduces the appearance of blemishes and keeps tanning under control. It contains Kojic Acid which is a skin whitening or pigmentation agent. Kojic Acid cream is a powerful, high quality skin lightener, that evens skin tone, diminishes freckles, age spots and hyper pigmentation caused by sun damage by 50% in just 2 weeks</div>',8,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2018-12-01','2021-11-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-06-17 00:28:49','2021-08-14 12:02:14'),(9,'Regency Feet Care Cream','regency-feet-care-cream-2020-07-15.jpg',350.00,0.00,0.00,150.00,7,3,1,'<div>With daily physical activity, the heels and soles of the feet are prone to dryness and cracks. Unattended deep cracks in the feet can become infected and develop into wounds. Applying a urea-containing cream like Regency Feet Care Cream to the feet regularly can help the skin to stay hydrated and prevent against complications.This cream also contains Salicylic acid which is a keratolytic agent (peeling agent) that causes shedding of the outer layer of the skin. So it is used to remove corns, calluses and warts on your feet. Aloe Vera soothes and moisturizes dry and cracked skin. Cocoa Butter enriched with Vitamin E provides a deep penetrating treatment for the feet. This unique formulation moisturizes, softens and smoothes even the roughest, driest skin. In addition to all these benefits, regular use of Regency Feet Care Cream can help to reduce callus buildup and provide relief from dry, itchy skin.</div>',8,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-06-17 00:31:24','2021-08-14 12:02:34'),(10,'Regency Cucumber Soap','regency-cucumber-soap-2020-07-15.jpg',150.00,0.00,0.00,130.00,7,2,1,'<div>The greatest and most important skin benefit of cucumber is that it helps in revitalizing the skin. It helps soothe sunburn, rejuvenate skin and reduce dark circles. The cleaning and cleansing property helps your skin tremendously making it soft and supple.</div>',4,'pos','[\"08101593666947.jpeg\"]',1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-06-17 00:33:56','2021-08-14 12:03:00'),(11,'Regency moisturizing  Body Lotion','regency-moisturizing-body-lotion-2020-07-15.jpg',250.00,0.00,0.00,240.00,1,4,1,'<div>Regency moisturizing Body Lotion contains Almond Oil and Honey Extract. Thanks to the Vitamin E, almond oil keeps your skin cells healthy, protects your skin from UV radiation damage, and helps your skin look smooth, soft, and free of fine lines. The fatty acids help your skin retain moisture and can heal chapped and irritated skin. Plus, the vitamin A can help reduce acne.The antioxidants in Honey nourish damaged skin, potentially helping the scar healing process. Honey\\\\\\\'s natural antiseptic properties help prevent infections and protects wounds which can reduce scarring and cut down on healing time.</div>',2,'pos',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'2020-06-17 00:37:59','2021-10-12 19:33:11'),(20,'Medicom Surgical Mask','medicom-surgical-mask-2020-07-15.jpg',70.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,2,9,6,'<div>lorem</div>',11,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-03 09:32:28','2021-08-14 12:04:01'),(21,'Surgical Cap','surgical-cap-2020-07-03.jpg',20.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,2,12,6,'<div>Sugical Cap</div>',11,'ecom','[\"08601593785112.jpeg\",\"15011593785112.jpeg\"]',1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-03 12:04:25','2021-05-30 16:10:44'),(22,'pulse oximeter','pulse-oximeter-2020-07-23.png',1500.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,3,10,7,'<div>Integrate blood oxygen probe and process display module into one The product is small in size, light in weight and easy to carry. The product is easy to use and has low power consumption Blood oxygen saturation value display, pulse rate value, bar graph display, pulse waveform display, battery power indicator Can change the display mode 4 directions change</div>',11,'ecom','[]',1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-03 12:38:08','2021-05-30 15:22:47'),(23,'Keshori Hair Cool Oil (200 ml)','keshori-hair-cool-oil-2020-07-15.jpg',150.00,0.00,0.00,135.00,1,11,8,'<div>*Prevent Headache *Cool You Head</div>',2,'pos','[\"03361593832793.jpeg\",\"13121593832794.jpeg\"]',1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 01:19:54','2021-05-29 19:39:33'),(24,'Hair Grow Hair Oil','hair-grow-hair-oil-2020-07-15.jpg',250.00,0.00,0.00,140.00,1,11,8,'<div>সম্পূর্ণ আয়ুর্বেদিক ভেষজ উপাদান সমৃদ্ধ \"হেয়ার গ্রো হেয়ার অয়েল\" *চুল পড়া রোধ করে * খুশকি দূর করে</div>',1,'pos','[\"09501593834661.jpeg\",\"16041593834662.jpeg\"]',1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 01:51:03','2021-05-29 19:29:05'),(25,'Regency Hair Oil','regency-hair-oil-2020-07-15.jpg',300.00,0.00,0.00,220.00,8,11,1,'<div>Regency Herbal Hair Oil is a herbal product containing a combination of Til Oil and Coconut Oil which are popularly used for hair growth and to maintain scalp health. Til Oil is enriched with Vitamin-E, B complex, and minerals such as magnesium, calcium, phosphorus and protein that strengthens the hair from the roots and deeply nourishes it. They also help prevent premature graying of hair. Both these oils are useful to treat dandruff. This Oil also contains other herbal products like Amla, Bhringraj, Brahmi Extract, Jaborandi Extract, Arnica Extract, etc. All these promote hair growth and delay graying of hair. All these ingredients are helpful in making your hair healthy.</div>',1,'ecom','[\"05451593835497.jpeg\",\"11001593835498.jpeg\"]',0,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 02:04:58','2021-05-30 15:58:43'),(26,'Regency Fairness Facewash','regency-fairness-facewash-2020-07-15.jpg',250.00,0.00,0.00,120.00,7,7,1,'<div>Gentle For Every Skin Regency Fairness Facewash Cleanses your skin &amp; glow you much</div>',1,'ecom',NULL,0,1,'2018-04-01','2021-03-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-06-12 14:04:11','2021-05-30 15:57:19'),(27,'Revera Lotion','revera-lotion-2020-10-04.jpg',380.00,0.00,0.00,150.00,8,13,1,'<div>.</div>',1,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:08:17','2021-08-14 12:05:02'),(28,'Regency Sun Screen Lotion (SPF-50)','regency-sun-screen-lotion-spf-50-2020-10-05.jpg',1800.00,0.00,0.00,275.00,7,17,1,'<div>.</div>',1,'pos',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:08:56','2021-08-14 12:04:41'),(29,'Octalite Soap','octalite-soap-2021-01-24.jpg',350.00,0.00,0.00,120.00,7,2,1,'<div>Ocalite Soap Basically used for Acne Treatment. It Contains Anti Bacterial agent whch can prevent skin infection<br><br><strong>Ingredients: </strong><br>&nbsp;benzoyl peroxide with clindamycin</div>',14,'pos','[\"05491611464304.jpeg\",\"18011611464304.jpeg\"]',1,1,'2018-12-01','2021-11-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:09:51','2021-08-15 00:18:09'),(30,'Zitlite B Soap','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,NULL,120.00,1,2,3,'<div>.</div>',14,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2018-08-01','2021-07-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:10:23','2021-01-18 11:30:11'),(31,'Dan k Soap','dan-k-soap-2021-02-01.jpg',400.00,0.00,0.00,120.00,7,2,1,'<div>Dan-K Soap has an elegant antifungal &amp; antibacterial property. Its contents like Ketoconazole &amp; Zinc Pyrithione is an antibacterial and anti fungal agent. It is effective in reducing and controlling bacterial contamination. Ketoconazole is an anti fungal drug used to prevent and treat skin and fungal infections. Zinc Pyrithione is best known for its use in treating dandruff and seborrhoiec dermatitis. It also has antibacterial properties and is effective against many pathogens. Aloevera helps treat inflammation, wounds and burns. The anti-allergic property of Aloe Vera is useful in the treatment of various skin diseases like eczema, psoriasis, itchy skin and so on. Glycerin is a wonderful skin moisturizer which helps retain skin water making it soft.</div>',4,'pos','[\"0231611472387.jpeg\"]',1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:11:37','2021-08-15 00:17:42'),(32,'Permiscab Soap','permiscab-soap-2021-01-19.jpg',400.00,0.00,0.00,130.00,7,2,3,'<div>Permiscab Anti Lice &amp; Anti Scabies Soap<br>Permiscab soap has an elegant anti-Lice &amp; anti-scabies property. Its contents like Permethrin is an anti-lice and anti scabies agent used to eradicate parasities such as head lice and mites responsible for scabiesm Aloe Vera extracts has antibacterial and antifungal property,which may help in the treatment of wound and burn healing,minor skin infections. It is a natural skin moisturizer &amp; conditioner which revitalizes the skin.<br>Direction for use: Apply Permiscab Soap to the affected part of the skin &amp; rub gently to develop the rich later. Protect from heat &amp; Light.<br>Avoid Contact with Eyes If Contact Occurs. Flush With Water Immediately.<br><br>Composition:&nbsp;<br>Permethrin 1.0% v/w<br>Aloe Vera 4.0% v/w<br>Glycerin Ip 3.5% v/w<br>Soap Noodles o.s<br>Excipients o.s<br>Perfume and Colour:<br>Titanium Dioxide<br>Net Wt. :75 gm.(When Packed)<br><br>Mfgr.&amp;Exporter:<br>Elegant International<br>Plot No.33,G.I.D.C.,Kuvadava-360 023.<br>Country of Origin India<br><br></div><div><br><br></div>',4,'pos','[\"08271611022785.jpeg\",\"18911611022785.jpeg\"]',1,1,'2019-10-01','2022-09-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:12:11','2021-08-14 12:08:21'),(33,'Permiscab Lotion','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,NULL,150.00,1,29,1,'<div>.</div>',1,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2020-03-01','2023-02-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:13:04','2021-01-18 12:01:43'),(34,'Ketocite Soap','ketocite-soap-2021-02-01.jpg',400.00,0.00,0.00,120.00,7,2,3,'<div><strong>Product Description :</strong><br><br></div><div>Composition :<br>Ketoconazole USP 2% w/w<br>Zinc Pyrithione 1% w/w<br>Alovera 2% w/w<br>Glycererin USP 3% w/w<br>Soap Noodles Q.S.<br>Excipients Q.S.<br>color Brilliants Blue FCF</div>',14,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:13:28','2021-08-14 12:07:39'),(35,'Ketocite CT Shampoo','ketocite-ct-shampoo-2020-10-23.jpg',650.00,0.00,0.00,180.00,8,6,3,'<div>Ketocite-CT is a Keratoytic and Antifungal. It works by slowing bacterial growth and loosing and softening scales and crust.Ketoconazoleis antifungal agent which offers antifungal action while the Coal Tar relieving itching, scaling, dryness, and flaking of the skin due to dandruff, psoriasis and seborrhea.</div>',1,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:13:41','2021-10-09 00:04:49'),(36,'Dermolite Cream','dermolite-cream-2020-10-05.jpg',600.00,0.00,0.00,220.00,7,3,3,'<ul><li>Clinically proven</li><li>For even skin tone and glow</li><li>Reduces brown and dark spots</li><li>Makes the skin firmer</li></ul><div><br></div>',3,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2021-01-01','2023-12-01',1,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:14:19','2021-10-08 23:56:40'),(37,'Dermolite Sun Screen Lotion SPF-50','dermolite-sun-screen-lotion-spf-50-2020-11-26.jpg',390.00,0.00,0.00,220.00,7,17,3,'<div>Dermolite Sunscreen Lotion SPF-50 সান বার্ন ও ড্রাইনেস প্রটেক্ট করে&nbsp;</div><div>সূর্যের ক্ষতিকর&nbsp; UVA এবং UVB থেকে প্রটেক্ট করে</div>',17,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:14:41','2021-08-14 12:06:10'),(38,'Ketonil Soap','ketonil-soap-2021-01-24.jpg',400.00,0.00,0.00,140.00,7,2,1,'<div>Ketonil Anti Fungal Soap basically used for fungal &amp; bacterial infection.<br><br><strong>Ingredients: <br></strong>Ketokonazole 2%, ZPTO 1% &amp; Aloevera 2%</div>',14,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2019-04-01','2022-03-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:15:01','2021-10-09 00:08:10'),(39,'Octatar Soap','octatar-soap-2021-01-24.jpg',400.00,0.00,0.00,120.00,8,2,1,'<div>Octatar Soap controls symptoms of psoriasis, dandruff &amp; other fungal infections. Its contents like Coal Tar &amp; Salicylic Acid are antiseptic, antibacterial and anti fungal agents. Coal Tar, known for its antiseptic qualities, has been used in dermatology for more than 100 years. Coal Tar is used in soaps, shampoos and ointments to treat psoriasis that is effective in reducing and controlling bacterial contamination. Salicylic acid is a keratolytic (peeling agent) that causes shedding of the outer layer of skin and so is used to treat psoriasis.</div><div><br><br></div>',14,'ecom','[\"03201611491592.jpeg\"]',1,1,'2020-06-01','2023-05-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:15:17','2021-10-09 00:11:35'),(40,'Glyrizer Lotion','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,NULL,180.00,1,4,1,NULL,1,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:15:38','2022-03-18 13:55:48'),(41,'Revera Hair Oil','revera-hair-oil-2020-10-04.jpg',370.00,0.00,0.00,220.00,8,11,3,'<ul><li>Revera Hair Oil being one among that which helps to recondition dry &amp; brittle hair. It nourishes unhealthy scalp, controls dandruff and helps control hair loss. This oil contains Arnica Extract rejuvenates your scalp and stimulates the hair follicles, helping to strengthen your hair.</li></ul><div><br><br></div><div><br></div>',1,'ecom',NULL,1,1,'2020-06-01','2023-05-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:16:00','2021-05-30 16:07:41'),(42,'Retisonate HM Cream','retisonate-hm-cream-2021-01-17.jpg',500.00,0.00,0.00,190.00,7,3,3,'<ul><li>মে্লাসমা দুর করে&nbsp;</li><li>ডার্ক স্পট দুর করে&nbsp;</li></ul>',3,'ecom',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:16:20','2021-05-30 16:06:41'),(43,'Eleclin A Gel','elicline-a-gel-2020-10-04.jpg',450.00,0.00,0.00,160.00,7,3,3,'<div>Eleclin Gel is a combination medicine that is used to treats acne. It minimizes excessive oil production, thus reduces inflammation. It also prevents the growth of the microorganisms that cause acne. This also helps to prevent pimples, blackheads, and whiteheads on the skin.<br><br>Eleclin Gel is only meant for external use and should be used as advised by your doctor. A thin layer of the medicine should be applied only to the affected areas of the skin with clean and dry hands. Wash your hands before and after applying the medicine. If it gets into your eyes, nose, mouth, or vagina rinse with water. It may take several days to weeks for your symptoms to improve, but you should keep using this medicine regularly. The course of the treatment should be completed to ensure better efficacy of the medicine. If your condition does not improve or gets worse, you should talk to your doctor.<br><br>This is usually a safe medicine, however, it may cause dryness, peeling, redness, and burning sensation at the application site. These side effects are usually mild and self-limiting. Most of these side effects can be prevented by using a skin moisturizer and drinking plenty of water. Serious side effects are rare. You must consult the doctor if you experience any allergic reaction (rashes, itching, swelling, shortness of breath, etc.).<br><br>Before using this medicine, it is important to tell your doctor if you are taking or have recently taken any other medicines for the same disease or other diseases. Pregnant and breastfeeding women should use this medicine with proper consultation and caution. If you are a known allergic to the medicine, you must refrain from using this medicine and consult your doctor. During the course of the treatment, do not touch, prick or scratch the infected skin areas as this may worsen or spread the acne. Avoid unnecessary sun exposure and use a sunscreen before stepping out in the sun. It is also advised, not to receive any cosmetic procedures without asking your doctor.</div>',9,'ecom',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:16:41','2021-05-29 19:25:03'),(44,'Femilite Hygenic Wash','femilite-hygenic-wash-2020-10-04.jpg',550.00,0.00,0.00,170.00,8,14,3,'<div>Femilite contains ingredients like Sea Buckthorn Extract, which is a great natural cleanser. This Extract is rich in vitamin A, C and E, nutrients like carotenoids, etc. and it also has antioxidant properties. It also contains Tea Tree oil which helps treat vaginal infections by killing bacteria and fungus and reducing allergic skin reactions. Daily washing with Femilite leaves a fresh feeling and helps maintain healthy vaginal flora, prevent unpleasant odour and irritations of the intimate areas. Chamomile Extract has anti-bacterial, anti-inflammatory, anti-fungal and anti-allergic properties and is used topically to treat inflammation of the skin and skin diseases. Lactic Acid exfoliates the skin.</div>',1,'ecom',NULL,1,1,'2018-10-01','2021-09-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:16:59','2021-05-29 19:26:49'),(45,'none','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,NULL,0.00,1,1,1,'<div>j</div>',12,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:17:13','2020-11-07 16:31:28'),(46,'Seloma Under Eye Cream','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,NULL,180.00,1,3,11,NULL,3,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2019-01-01','2021-06-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:17:25','2022-03-18 14:14:41'),(47,'DM Glow','dm-glow-2020-07-16.jpg',600.00,0.00,0.00,220.00,1,3,11,'<ul><li>Melasma</li><li>Skin Whitening</li><li>Remove Black Spot</li><li>Anti-Ageing</li></ul><div><br></div>',3,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:17:36','2021-05-29 19:25:22'),(48,'Hermonc Cream','hermonc-cream-2020-07-06.jpg',850.00,0.00,0.00,320.00,7,3,11,'<div>Fight fine lines, sagging skin, and wrinkles with a blend of Anti-aging peptides, Nourishing botanicals and other naturally derived ingredients to nurture aging skin. Powerful peptides team up with vitamins B, C, and E as well as Shea Butter &amp; Aloe Vera Extract to help target wrinkles while helping to lift and firm areas of the face &amp; neck. Hyaluronic acid encourages improved moisture levels on the skin’s surface, while Melavoid make the skin looking clear and vibrant. The results: a nourished, balanced and restored complexion. This is a nonsticky paraben free anti-aging formula which is suitable for all types of skin, including sensitive one.<br><br><strong>ACTIVE CONTENT:<br></strong><br></div><div><strong>Aloe Vera Ext</strong> 5 %<br><br></div><div><strong>Liquorice Ext.</strong> 2 %<br><br></div><div><strong>Hyaluronic Acid</strong> 0.5 %<br><br></div><div><strong>Niacinamide</strong> 2 %<br><br></div><div><strong>Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate</strong> 2 %<br><br></div><div><strong>D-Panthenol</strong> 0.2 %<br><br></div><div><strong>Octyl Methoxy Cinnamate</strong> 2 %<br><br></div><div><strong>Vitamin E Acetate</strong> 0.5 %<br><br></div><div><strong>Haloxyl </strong>1%<br><br></div><div><strong>Melavoid</strong>&nbsp; 1 %<br><br></div>',9,'ecom','[\"07521594039618.jpeg\",\"19331594039618.jpeg\"]',1,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:17:49','2021-05-29 19:34:21'),(49,'Lumofa Facewash Gel','lumofa-fw-2020-09-30.png',400.00,0.00,0.00,120.00,7,7,11,'<div>Lumofa Facewash Gel স্কিন পোরস গুলি পরিষ্কার করে ও সেগুলি বন্ধ করে এর এন্টি এজিং ফর্মুলা ডেড স্কিন সেল গুলি রিপেয়ার করে ও আপনাকের ফিরিয়ে দেয় তারুণ্য</div>',13,'ecom',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:18:03','2021-05-30 15:18:4