inc Pyrithione is best known for its use in treating dandruff and seborrhoeic dermatitis. It also has antibacterial properties and is effective against many pathogens.<br><br></div><div><strong>Usage:</strong><br>Apply Ketolite Soap to the affected part of the skin and rub gently to develop a rich lather. After two minutes rinse off thoroughly.<br><br></div><div><br></div><div><br><br></div>',4,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:24:05','2021-10-09 00:06:53'),(73,'Uveelite Sunscreen Lotion SPF-50','uveelite-sunscreen-lotion-spf-50-2020-11-09.png',650.00,0.00,0.00,200.00,1,17,3,'<ul><li>High SPF for more sun protection. Formulated for use on your face and body.</li><li>Moisturizes skin to prolong your tan.</li><li>After-sun and dual-action protection.</li><li>Ideal for blemish-prone skin.</li><li>Maintains the skin\'s natural moisture balance.</li></ul><div><br></div>',17,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2019-10-01','2022-09-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:24:51','2021-05-30 16:11:42'),(74,'Zitsome  Lotion','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,NULL,200.00,1,29,1,NULL,17,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:25:04','2022-03-18 14:08:23'),(76,'Leads Soap','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,NULL,160.00,1,1,1,NULL,14,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2020-01-01','2022-12-31',0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06:25:45','2021-01-19 10:25:06'),(77,'Permilte Anti-Lice Lotion','permilte-anti-lice-lotion-2021-01-22.jpg',300.00,0.00,0.00,170.00,8,29,3,'<div>Permilite Lotion has an elegant anti-lice &amp; antiscabies property. Its contents like Permethrin is an anti-lice and anti-scabies agent used to eradicate parasites such as head lice and mites responsible for scabies.<br><br><strong>Ingredients: <br></strong>Permethrin 5.00 % w/w, Lotion Base Q.S.<br><br><strong>Usage: </strong><br>Apply Permilite Lotion thoroughly to all body parts from head to toe and leave the medication on for 8 to 14 hours, then wash off completely. One application is generally curative.<br><br></div>',9,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-07-04 06: