y. For best results use twice or thrice a day regularly.</div><div><br><br></div>',17,'ecom','[\"06131611467540.jpeg\",\"11911611467541.jpeg\"]',1,1,'2020-10-01','2023-09-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-08-10 22:11:30','2021-05-29 19:20:20'),(89,'Glessom Strech Mark Cream','glessom-strech-mark-cream-2020-10-04.jpg',400.00,0.00,0.00,260.00,7,3,3,'<div>.This nourishine cream contains ingredients which help to noticeably improve the appearance of depth, colour, and depression of existing stretch marks. It also helps to provide additional moisture to replenish the skin and rejuvenation to the rough dry feeling areas on the skin surface. It makes the skin look smoother, film and toned. It also helps provide a healthier overall appearance of the skin by enhancing skin elasticity. It is useful for all skin types.</div><div><br><br></div>',8,'ecom',NULL,1,1,'2018-12-01','2021-11-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-08-11 19:27:22','2021-10-09 00:00:37'),(90,'Biotin Hair Care','product.jpg',200.00,0.00,0.00,260.00,2,37,21,NULL,36,'pos',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-08-12 16:36:56','2022-03-18 13:45:17'),(91,'Ketocite Shampoo','ketocite-shampoo-2021-02-01.png',600.00,0.00,0.00,180.00,8,6,3,'<div>Ketocite shampoo contains a medically proven ingredients ketoconazole 2%that treats the root cause of dandruff and provides long lasting relief without irritating the scalp. Ketoconazole 2%has been intensively researched the world over and has been found to be most effective medicinal agent against P.ovale, the root cause of dandruff, Ketoconazole effectively fights. P.ovale,the micro-organism that causes dandruff. Ketocite\'s superior action is extremely effective on dandruff but very gentle on hair, unlike other dandruff treatment products. Ketocite can be freely used on colored, dyed hair or hair groomed with hair gel &amp; fixed. This gives the real freedom from dandruff.</div>',1,'ecom',NULL,1,1,'2018-12-01','2021-11-01',0,0,NULL,'2020-08-13 19:09:44','2021-10-09 00:05:24'),(92,'Biomed','product.jpg',110.0