bsp; It has the ability to penetrate deeper with its liposomal structure.&nbsp;</div>',1,'ecom',NULL,1,1,'2019-09-01','2022-02-01',1,0,NULL,'2020-11-07 12:20:56','2021-05-29 19:28:06'),(149,'Quitriz Anti Scar Gel','quitriz-anti-scar-gel-2020-11-07.jpg',600.00,0.00,0.00,250.00,7,3,11,'<ul><li>Best for face scar</li></ul><div><br></div>',3,'pos',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-11-07 13:25:29','2021-05-30 15:54:50'),(150,'Olivrix Cream','olivrix-cream-2020-11-07.jpg',850.00,0.00,0.00,220.00,7,3,11,'<div>Innovative formulation for acne. Olivrix is proven to be effective in preventing acne with the power of 3 active ingredients Nicotinamide, Calendula Extract and Zinc PCA.&nbsp; Nicotinamide reduces inflammation and Zinc PCA helps to decrease sebum secretion. Olivrix can be used alone or in combination with conventional acne therapy. Olivrix represents a complete daily management of signs and symptoms of light to moderate acne thanks to a unique combination of anti-inflammatory &amp; anti-adhesive barrier ingredients. Directions For Use : Apply OLIVRIX oil-free cream to the skin areas after cleansing twice a day, morning and night. Massage delicately to facilitate absorption.<br><br><br>ACTIVE CONTENT:<br><br>Zinc PCA 0.5 %<br><br>Vitamin E 0.2 %<br><br>Calendula Extract 2 %<br><br>Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate 2 %<br><br>Niacinamide 2 %<br><br>PRESENTATION : 20 gm</div>',27,'ecom',NULL,1,1,'2019-11-01','2022-04-01',1,0,NULL,'2020-11-07 13:41:38','2021-05-30 15:21:23'),(151,'Elimastria Anti-Stretch Mark Cream','elimastria-anti-stretch-mark-cream-2020-11-07.jpg',850.00,0.00,0.00,330.00,1,3,11,'<div>Stretchmark removal purpose</div>',18,'pos',NULL,1,1,'2019-12-01','2022-05-01',1,0,NULL,'2020-11-07 13:43:54','2021-08-15 15:48:45'),(152,'Vico Moisturizing  Body Lotion','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,0.00,95.00,1,4,8,'<div>.</div>',2,'pos',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'2020-11-09 12:55:04','2020-11-27 01:21:37'),(153,'Vico Whitening Body Lotion','product.jpg',0.00,NULL,0.00,140.00,1,4,