 will give you a skin that\'s fair and glowing from within. enhances the complexion, evens out skin tone, imparts a natural glow, lightens the skin, reduces the appearance of blemishes and keeps tanning under control. It contains Kojic Acid which is a skin whitening or pigmentation agent. Kojic Acid cream is a powerful, high quality skin lightener, that evens skin tone, diminishes freckles, age spots and hyper pigmentation caused by sun damage by 50% in just 2 weeks</div>',32,'ecom','[\"03831612342559.jpeg\"]',1,1,'2019-04-01','2022-03-01',0,0,NULL,'2021-02-03 14:56:00','2021-05-29 19:24:43'),(205,'Revera Moisturizing Cream (Tuni Pack)','revera-moisturizing-cream-tuni-pack-2021-02-03.jpg',150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,7,3,3,'<div><strong>Ingredients:<br></strong>Stearic Acid, Light Liquid Paraffin, Glycerin, Aloevera Extract,&nbsp; Glycerol Mono Stearate,&nbsp; Vitamin B3, Cetyl Alcohol,&nbsp; Perfume, Cyclopentasiloxane, Dimethiconol,&nbsp; Vitamin E, M-Shuttle-SC, Titanium Dioxide, Potassium Hydroxide,&nbsp; Sodium Methylparaben,&nbsp; Phenoxyethanol, &nbsp; EDTA, Sodium Propylparaben, Butylated Hydroxytoluene &amp; Water.&nbsp;<br><br></div><div><strong>Description:<br></strong>Revera Aloevera Moisturizing Cream is a daily, Aloevera with multi-vitamin facial treatment, that improves the texture and appearance of your skin. It eases away the appearance of fine lines, blotches and discolorations for a more vibrant, even-toned complexion. Vitamin A, C &amp; E have natural anti-oxidant, moisturizer as well as emollient properties which help fight environmental damage &amp; prevent dryness of the skin. Revera Aloevera Moisturizing Cream soothes &amp; heals dry, damaged or sensitive skin, skin rashes &amp; irritations. <br><br><strong>Direction For Use:</strong><br>Apply Revera Aloevera Moisturizing Cream and massage gently on the skin. For best results apply regularly twice a day.</div><div><br></div>',3,'ecom','[\"01471612344557.jpeg\"]',1,1,'2019-05-01','2022-04-01',0,0,NUL